===============================================================================
REFERENCE CURVE: the same metric on a perturbation whose
effect on the identification statistic is already known
===============================================================================
  Seed jitter of standard deviation sigma d_mean is the
  perturbation microstructure_error.py sweeps, and its effect
  on the published statistic is measured at every level there.
  Putting it in the metric above converts a candidate
  separation into a statement about the test.

